The self-authored example slide decks in this directory — corporate.json,
arty.json, equations.json, multilingual-rtl.json, torture.json — together with
the abstract SVG artwork they embed and the generator script build-decks.mjs,
were authored for the edot slides app and are dedicated to the public domain.

